<h2 style="text-align:center;"> We're Celebrating Earth Day</h2>
<p>Here at ALA we are celebrating Earth Day by being enviromental-friendly! With all our <i>Ideas</i> we came up with the simple but helpful idea of keeping lights off to save power. </p>
